l,"result":"I approve PKT-0075. The one problem from the previous rejection is fixed, and the rest of the delivery matches the goal and the contract.\n\n**The fix from the rejection.** The follow-up request in `.theseus/spawn/` no longer has placeholders.\n- **Target:** the flaky test file, `tests/unit/docsCoServerCrashPaths.tests.js`.\n- **Contract:** no production code under `DocService/` or `Common/` may change, no test may be weakened, and retry or config settings that hide the flake are forbidden.\n- **Acceptance:** run `unit.sh` once, then five times in a row, then lint.\n\nThe Spawned packets section of the packet lists the request too.\n\n**Goal.** The packet has no target files, so the change is delivered as a patch plus a decision note under `.theseus/diagnosis`, as the goal allows.\n- **One hook point:** `x2t -create-js-snapshots` runs in `documentserver-generate-allfonts.sh`, right after the js cache step. That one script covers deb install, deb upgrade, the font trigger and Docker start-up.\n- **Stale snapshots:** old `sdk-all.bin` files are deleted before generation and again if x2t fails, so an upgrade never keeps one from another build. A failure falls back to running without snapshots and prints a warning; it never breaks the install.\n- **Ownership:** the script's existing `chown -R ds:ds` makes the files belong to `ds`.\n- **Removal:** `postrm` now also deletes `sdk-all.bin`, since the files are not in the package's file list.\n- **Evidence:** the executor ran the patched script as root on the VM. All five snapshots were recreated with owner `ds`, the healthcheck returned true, and a docx→pdf conversion as `ds` took 0.51 s.\n\n**Contract and budget.** No JS was touched, so the existing tests are unaffected. The diff is 5 files and 150 added lines, within the 6-file and 800-line budget.\n\n**Not covered.** Neither of these blocks the approval:\n- A real install of a rebuilt package and a Docker build were not done, because there is no fork and no Docker. The Executor log says so.\n- That the Euro-Office Docker image calls `documentserver-generate-allfonts.sh` at start-up is assumed from upstream, not checked. It should be checked once the fork exists.\n\n**Flaky test.** The unrelated flaky test is handed off to a follow-up rather than hidden. This is not a characterize packet, so the rule that surprises must be kept in a test does not apply.\n\nVERDICT: APPROVE patch+note meet the goal (correct hook point, stale-.bin removal, ds ownership, postrm cleanup), limits stated, spawn request now complete","ttft_ms":2145,"type":"result","duration_ms":14587,"uuid":"76aefb09-96c7-435e-a79e-28d30d6c1424","ttft_stream_ms":966,"time_to_request_ms":344,"time_to_request_phases_ms":{"other":5,"system_prompt":228,"resume_other":0,"process_user_input":3,"input_attachments":18,"input_hooks":2,"conversation_append":1,"transcript_persist":13,"tool_pool_refresh":1,"init_message":5,"init_frame_send":3,"engine_pickup":1,"loop_entry":3,"message_prep":1,"model_config_wait":1,"autocompact":2,"request_announcements":10,"query_setup":3,"auto_mode_context_wait":9,"model_gates":0,"tool_schema_build":22,"message_normalization":2,"client_creation":2,"request_build":9},"turn_start_resume_kind":"none","process_turn_index":0,"time_to_request_loop_lag_ms":26,"time_to_request_cpu_ms":138,"time_to_request_major_faults":0,"process_rss_mib_turn_start":215,"process_anon_mib_turn_start":140,"process_rss_mib_result":225,"process_anon_mib_result":138,"process_peak_rss_mib":251,"process_cpu_ms_turn":809,"process_wall_ms_turn":14587,"process_cpu_ms_streaming":372,"process_wall_ms_streaming":11544,"main_stream_count":4,"main_stream_event_count":238,"main_stream_chunk_count":71,"input_attachments_detail":{"slowest_producer":"artifact_opening_prefetch","slowest_producer_ms":8,"cpu_ms":18,"major_faults":0,"setup_ms":0,"prompt_producers_ms":0,"ambient_start_ms":7,"ambient_wait_ms":7,"render_ms":1,"producers":41,"token_counts":0},"first_content_frame_ms":969,"t